; A zone BIND holds as the primary and Tenko as a secondary zone (WP6.1). smoke.sh adds
; a record with nsupdate; BIND notifies Tenko, which transfers the change by IXFR.
$TTL 60
@       IN SOA  ns.example.test. hostmaster.example.test. ( 1 60 10 3600 5 )
        IN NS   ns.example.test.
www     IN A    192.0.2.50
